  "scope": "Full pre-registered enumeration of the protocol section-18 temporal-holdout program (5 AI-art strategies x 1 encoder + 6 Korean-forest strategies x 3 encoders = 23 evaluation cells). Every paired significance test reported from this program comes from exactly these cells; the Holm families below are recomputed from this file by tests/test_run_matrix.py.",
